<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AgendaTech - Painel de Agendamentos</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
  body { background-color: #0b112c; background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #1a234d 10%, #0b112c 90%); min-height: 100vh; color: #ffffff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  
  /* Topbar / Cabeçalho */
  header { 
    display: flex; 
    justify-content: space-between; 
    align-items: center; 
    padding: 20px 40px; 
    background-color: rgba(11, 17, 44, 0.8); 
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); 
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
    position: relative;
  }
  .brand-section { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
  .logo-image { width: 50px; height: auto; }
  .brand-name { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
  
  /* Título Centralizado */
  .center-title {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4facfe;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .user-profile { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
  .user-name { color: #8fa0dd; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn-sair { padding: 8px 16px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 20px; color: #ffffff; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; }
  .btn-sair:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-color: #ff4f4f; color: #ff4f4f; }
  
  /* Conteúdo Principal */
  main { flex: 1; padding: 40px; max-width: 1200px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
  .welcome-text { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .welcome-text h1 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .welcome-text p { color: #8fa0dd; font-size: 16px; }
  
  /* Container e Estilização da Tabela */
  .table-container { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; overflow-x: auto; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; min-width: 600px; }
  th, td { padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
  th { background: linear-gradient(to right, #2575fc, #6a11cb); color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  th:first-child { border-top-left-radius: 10px; border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; }
  th:last-child { border-top-right-radius: 10px; border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; }
  tr:hover td { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); color: #4facfe; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
  td { color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 15px; }
  .horario-cell { font-weight: bold; color: #8fa0dd; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
  
  /* Responsividade */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    header { padding: 20px; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; text-align: center; }
    .center-title { position: static; transform: none; margin-top: 5px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand-section">
    <img src="https://postimg.cc" alt="Logo AgendaTech" class="logo-image">
    <div class="brand-name">AgendaTech</div>
  </div>
  
  <!-- Texto Centralizado Alterado para Tablets -->
  <div class="center-title">Tablets</div>

  <div class="user-profile">
    <span class="user-name">Olá, Usuário</span>
    <button class="btn-sair" onclick="window.location.href='#'">Sair</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="welcome-text">
    <h1>Quadro de Horários por Turma</h1>
    <p>Confira a distribuição das aulas e turmas nos respectivos períodos.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="table-container">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Horário</th>
          <th>6º Ano</th>
          <th>7º Ano</th>
          <th>8º Ano</th>
          <th>9º Ano</th>
          <th>1 TDS</th>
          <th>2 TDS</th>
          <th>3 TDS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="horario-cell">07:25</td>
          <td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="horario-cell">08:15</td>
          <td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="horario-cell">09:05</td>
          <td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="horario-cell">10:05</td>
          <td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="horario-cell">11:45</td>
          <td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
